@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC3 View Booking Overview

actor Admin
participant "Admin UI\n(Thymeleaf)" as UI
participant "Booking API\n(Spring Boot)" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Admin -> UI : Open /admin/bookings
UI -> API : Request bookings\n(with JWT session)
API -> DB : Query bookings for period
DB --> API : Result list
API --> UI : Render booking data
UI --> Admin : Display booking table

@enduml
